        rdfs:comment                   "Pair of boots for a baby, cream silk with bows and floral embroidery, made in France, 1880-1889"@en , "Pair of cream silk baby boots, white flowers and green foliage embroidered in silk around the toe. Each boot has a self fabric bow at the front of the foot, with a paler cream silk bow and pleated trim at the ankle."@en ;
